    "specPath": "specs/046-secret-type/spec.md",
    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adds a small crate owning one secret-string type whose Debug and Display never show its value, whose bytes are zeroed when dropped, and whose value is read only through an explicit expose call. The provider token (statecraft-home) and the hosted credential (statecraft-hosted) migrate to it. Four structural rules adapted from preloop-ci are specified here and delivered in a later change that depends on spec 044's sg-scan.\n",
    "title": "One secret type: redacted when shown, cleared when dropped, exposed only by name"
  },
